                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Charles Ferdinand Duke de Berry was the younger son of Charles X of France and his wife, Marie Thérèse of Savoy.  
    The Duke de Berry was stabbed when leaving the opera with his wife, by a veteran of <persName key="NAP02">Napoleon’s </persName>
    army dedicated to the elimination of the royal family. Godwin recorded his assassination on the 
    13th, the day he was attacked, but he did not die until the following day. See also public events file.</p>
